4. Single blastocysts embryo transfer;

Exclusion Criteria:

1\. uterine abnormalities (double uterus, bicornuate uterus, unicornuate uterus and uterine mediastinum), intrauterine adhesions, endometriosis,adenomyosis, hydrosalpinx, and uterine fibroids (submucosal fibroids, non-mucosal fibroids\> 4 cm and/or endometrial pressure);

NCT03104582.eligibility_criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* Type II、III、IV Klatskin tumor patients;
* 18-90 years old

Exclusion Criteria:

* Unwillingness or inability to consent for the study;
* Coagulation dysfunction (INR\> 1.3) and low peripheral blood platelet count(\<50×109 / L) or using anti-coagulation drugs;
* Previous endoscopic sphincterectomy (EST) or endoscopic papillary balloon dilatation (EPBD);
* Any type of GI reconstruction;
